# baseline-home/.env.template — names only. No values.
#
# Secret values are never written to disk or committed. They arrive as
# environment variables passed into the trial container at run time
# (`docker run -e ANTHROPIC_API_KEY ...`), which Hermes reads directly —
# .env in HERMES_HOME is only a fallback location Hermes also checks, not
# a required one. seed_hermes_home() copies this file verbatim into every
# fresh home as `.env`, so what you see here is exactly what ships in
# every trial's HERMES_HOME.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
# AWS_SESSION_TOKEN
#
